Package: tuneup
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gnome-shell
Recommends: pkexec | policykit-1, pipewire-bin, wireplumber, alsa-utils, fwupd
Suggests: timeshift, deja-dup
Description: Tweaks, extensions and system tools for Ubuntu
 Tuneup brings the GNOME Tweaks settings, extension and theme stores,
 audio device setup, software management, cleanup and backup helpers
 into one application styled like GNOME Settings.
 .
 Every change it makes to settings is recorded and can be undone.
